    // shifted left by 4 (for the low-nibble path) or not (high-nibble path).
    // Entry i = bit_reverse_8(i << 4) for low nibble, bit_reverse_8(i) >> 4 for high nibble.
    // Combined: reverse(byte) = NibbleHigh[byte >> 4] | NibbleLow[byte & 0xF]
